            <p style="margin:0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#90A2AA;">
              A <span style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#C9E8ED;"
                >.feat</span
              > spec is cheap to write correctly only once the design has stopped moving, and Facet
              is where it stops moving. Moment also writes Gherkin <span
                style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#C9E8ED;"
                >.feature</span
              > files, but those document each flow. They are not the build step.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

